    "prediction": "google/gemma-4-31b-it",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "To find the expected value $\\langle w\\rangle$ of the number of heads when two fair coins are tossed, we identify the possible outcomes: {TT, TH, HT, HH}.\n\nThe possible values for $w$ are:\n- $w = 0$ (TT) with probability $1/4$\n- $w = 1$ (TH, HT) with probability $2/4 = 1/2$\n- $w = 2$ (HH) with probability $1/4$\n\nThe expected value is calculated as: $\\langle w\\rangle = (0 \\times 1/4) + (1 \\times 1/2) + (2 \\times 1/4) = 0 + 0.5 + 0.5 = 1$.\n\n\\boxed{B}",
