    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following is incorrectly named?\n\nOptions: \nA. MgO   magnesium oxide\nB. AgNO3   silver nitrate\nC. CuCl2   copper(II) chloride\nD. H2SO4   sulfuric acid\nE. K2Cr2O7   potassium dichromate\nF. Na2SO4   sodium sulfate\nG. Fe(NO3)3   iron(III) nitrate\nH. CaCl2   calcium chloride\nI. AlBr3   aluminum tribromide\nJ. Zn(NO3)2   zinc nitrate\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
