    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Use divergence therem to evaluate $\\iint_S \\vec{{F}} \\cdot d \\vec{{S}}$ where $\\vec{{F}} = yx^2 \\vec{{i}} + (xy^2 - 3z^4)\\vec{{j}} + (x^3+y^3)\\vec{{k}}$ and the surface $S$ consists of the sphere of radius 4 with $z \\le 0$ and $y \\le 0$. Note all three surfaces of this solid are included in $S$.\n\nOptions: \nA. -2.0\nB. -3.0\nC. 5.0\nD. -4.0\nE. 4.0\nF. 3.0\nG. 2.0\nH. 1.0\nI. -1.0\nJ. 0.0\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
