    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is the probability of a Type II error when a hypothesis test is being conducted at the 10% significance level (α = 0.10)?\n\nOptions: \nA. 0.80\nB. 0.01\nC. 0.50\nD. 0.20\nE. 1.00\nF. 0.001\nG. There is insufficient information to answer this question.\nH. 0.05\nI. 0.90\nJ. 0.10\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
