    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The extremes of temperature in New York, over a period of 50 years, differ by 116 Fahrenheit degrees. Express this 50 years, differ by 116 Fahrenheit degrees. Express this range range in Celsius degrees. in Celsius degrees.\n\nOptions: \nA. 58.7 C°\nB. 60.0 C°\nC. 52.3 C°\nD. 48.9 C°\nE. 80.0 C°\nF. 76.4 C°\nG. 70.2 C°\nH. 64.5 C°\nI. 62.0 C°\nJ. 55.6 C°\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
