    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: a train consists of 12 boggies , each boggy 15 metres long . the train crosses a telegraph post in 18 seconds . due to some problem , two boggies were detached . the train now crosses a telegraph post in\n\nOptions: \nA. 18 sec\nB. 12 sec\nC. 15 sec\nD. 20 sec\nE. none of these\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
