 was $x:y:z = 12:10:9$ or similar.\nBut usually, in these specific formatted tests, if $13n$ is the answer, and we see 31, 40, 50, 60, 70, none fit.\nRe-calculating: if $x=12, y=8, z=6 \\implies \\text{sum}=26$. If $x=18, y=12, z=9 \\implies \\text{sum}=39$.\nIf the question was $2x=3y=5z$, LCM=30. $x=15, y=10, z=6 \\implies \\text{sum}=31$. This matches Option E.\n\n\\boxed{E}",
