    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Find the Laplace transform of f(t) = cos kt, for t > 0, where k is a real constant.\n\nOptions: \nA. k / (s^2 + k^2), for s > 0\nB. k / (s^2 + k^2), for s < 0\nC. 1 / (s^2 + k^2), for s > 0\nD. k^2 / (s^2 + k^2), for s > 0\nE. s / (s^2 + k^2), for s < 0\nF. s / (s^2 + k^2), for s > 0\nG. k / (s^2 - k^2), for s > 0\nH. s^2 / (s^2 + k^2), for s > 0\nI. s / (s^2 - k^2), for s > 0\nJ. s / (s^2 - k^2), for s < 0\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
