    "global index": "MMLUPro_engineering_10219",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Using the definition of the bilateral z transform F (z) = ^\\infty\\sum_n=-\\infty f[n] z^-n, find the z - transform of f[n] = 3\\delta [n+2] + 4\\delta [n-1] + 2\\delta [n-3].\n\nOptions: \nA. 3z^-2 + 4z^-1 + 2z^3\nB. 3z^2+ 4z^-1 + 2z^-3\nC. 2z^3 + 4z^-2 + 3z^-1\nD. 4z^2+ 3z^-1 + 2z^-3\nE. 4z^-3 + 3z^-2 + 2z^-1\nF. 3z^2+ 2z^-1 + 4z^-3\nG. 2z^2+ 4z^-1 + 3z^-3\nH. 3z^3 + 4z + 2z^-2\nI. 4z^3 + 2z + 3z^-2\nJ. 2z^-1 + 3z^-3 + 4z^2\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
