      "generated_answer": "To find the probability, first calculate the total number of balls in the box:\nTotal balls = 7 (red) + 5 (white) + 4 (black) = 16 balls.\n\nThe probability of drawing a red ball is $P(R) = \\frac{\\text{Number of red balls}}{\\text{Total balls}} = \\frac{7}{16}$.\nThe probability of drawing a black ball is $P(B) = \\frac{\\text{Number of black balls}}{\\text{Total balls}} = \\frac{4}{16} = \\frac{1}{4}$.\n\nComparing these results to the options, Option E matches exactly.\n\n\\boxed{E}",
