    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In the F Jue Ya-yue scale, which of the following correctly describes the relationship between Bian Gong and Bian Zhi?\n\nOptions: \nA. The single note formed by the Bian Zhi ♭♭A and the Bian Gong C is an augmented third\nB. The compound notes formed by the Bian Zhi G and the Bian Gong C is a perfect eleventh\nC. The compound notes formed by the Bian Zhi ♭G and the Bian Gong ♭C is a perfect eleventh\nD. The compound interval formed by the Bian Zhi G and the Bian Gong ♭C is a diminished eleventh\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
