      "generated_answer": "Based on the provided context, the survivors live in a subterranean shelter located beneath the ruins of Philadelphia. This underground existence was necessitated by the deadly virus that wiped out almost all of humanity in 1996.\n\n\\boxed{Underground (in a subterranean shelter beneath the ruins of Philadelphia)}",
      "success": true,
