      "generated_answer": "When Mrs. Tittlemouse begins to pull out the moss from the storeroom, three or four bees put their heads out and buzz fiercely at her. She expresses her frustration that she does not \"let lodgings\" and considers seeking help to turn them out. Ultimately, she decides to leave the bees alone until after she has finished her dinner.\n\n\\boxed{Three or four bees put their heads out of the moss and buzz fiercely at her, leading her to decide to leave them alone until after dinner.}",
